      "message": "test(import): pin the inside-out STL fixture turn at import\n\nPR #1686 (#1672) turns a closed, isolated inward STL/OBJ body outward\nat import and notes the turn. The winding_align test of the inside-out\nfixture still expected the old refusal, so main was red. The test now\npins the turn: one note, 12 facets reversed, an outward body, and the\ntop face lays like the outward block. The refusal of an unturned\ninside-out body and the import refusal of a nested inward shell stay\npinned by their own tests.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\nFixes #1752",
